    <string name="guide_content">
        Isikhokelo Ngokuthe ngenyathelo\n
        1. Khetha ifoto ecacileyo nefaneleyo yeprofayili\n
        - Sebenzisa umfanekiso ophezulu okanye ilogo yobungcali.\n
        - Qinisekisa ukuba ifoto icacile kwaye ibonisa ubuso bakho.\n
        - Gwema imifanekiso engacacanga okanye esezantsi.\n
        2. Bhala isihloko esinamandla\n
        - Yenza sifutshane, sichaze, kwaye gqibezela isakhono sakho esiphambili.\n
        Umzekelo: “Umzobi weGrafikhi oNgcali | IiLogo kunye nezisombululo zeBranding”\n
        Iingcebiso zoBungcali:\n
        - Gxila ekucaceni nasekubeni nobuchule.\n
        - Sebenzisa amagama abalulekileyo abafundi abayi kuwalandela.\n
        - Yiba noqobo malunga nezakhono zakho nexesha lokuhanjiswa.
    </string>

